      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "I understand you're looking for quick relief. For most adults, taking 200-400mg of ibuprofen every 4-6 hours can help with headache relief. However, don't exceed the maximum dose of 1200mg in a 24-hour period, unless advised by a healthcare professional. Make sure to also drink plenty of water and consider an antacid or Tums to help with stomach issues, as ibuprofen won't address them directly.",
