      "content": "thanks. i think i'll just take two of the 400mg ones to be safe, so 800mg at once? i really need this headache to go away so i can sleep. also, if i take some antacids at the same time as the ibuprofen, will that stop it from hurting my stomach more? i just want to make sure i can take it without making the stomach pain worse.",
